fin-orders:ExecutionLegShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "An Execution Leg is an optional single-leg execution component corresponding to an OrderLeg, used as an extension point for multi-leg executions whose full semantics are completed via a cross-module follow-up gated on the instruments QuotationConvention (ADR-021). In v1.1.0 a single-instrument execution carries no ExecutionLeg and remains described directly on the Execution.";
    sh:name "Execution Leg";
