fin-orders:OrderIntentLineageShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "An Order Intent Lineage is an immutable, source-evidenced routing transformation fact, used for connecting an exact set of source intent versions to an exact set of result intent versions to express the domain provenance of a split or aggregation, without representing any external side effect such as order submission.";
