fin-orders:OrderRevisionShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "An Order Revision is an immutable cancel/replace chain fact that links a revision request to its previous and root order, used to express the FIX ClOrdID/OrigClOrdID-style order chain with replace, cancel, cancel-replace, reject, replaced terms, and a priority-preserved flag, rather than a single fixed order identifier updated in place.";
